  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social media 2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sociala medier 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social media is used as an important channel in the communication work and the cost is mostly used for a content producer, but also for digital services (such as Tagboard) as well as making sponsored posts on Facebook, Twitter and Instagram. A large part of the budget will also be used for campaigns through so-called &quot;Influencers&quot;, such as young Swedish ambassadors for the global goals.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sociala medier anv&#xe4;nds som en viktig kanal i kommunikationsarbetet och kostnaden anv&#xe4;nds till st&#xf6;rsta delen till en inneh&#xe5;llsproducent, men &#xe4;ven till digitala tj&#xe4;nster (som exempelvis Tagboard) samt att g&#xf6;ra sponsrade inl&#xe4;gg p&#xe5; Facebook, Twitter och Instagram. En stor del av budgeten kommer &#xe4;ven att anv&#xe4;ndas till kampanjer genom s&#xe5; kallade &#x201d;Influencers&#x201d;, exempelvis svensk ambassad&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r de Globala m&#xe5;len.</narrative>
  </description>
